# tests/adapt V-14/F-05: non-uniform growth at constant mass, newton off, non-periodic:
# |P|/(M vrms) must stay < 1e-12 on 1/2/4/8 ranks (release: 4e-6..8e-6 on >1 rank).
hard_particles yes
atom_style granular
atom_modify map array
boundary f f f
newton off
communicate single vel yes
units si
region domain block -0.012 0.012 -0.012 0.012 -0.012 0.012 units box
create_box 1 domain
neighbor 0.0002 bin
neigh_modify delay 0
fix m1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 10000000.0
fix m2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.3
fix m3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix m4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.0
fix m5 all property/global characteristicVelocity scalar 1.0

pair_style gran model hertz tangential no_history
pair_coeff * *
timestep 1e-6
create_atoms 1 single -0.007 -0.007 -0.007 units box
